## Report

**Measurements**
- *Oracle envelope* (recorded, `tests/repro/claims/size-envelope.observed`, pinned v0.69 @ ededa3d, seed 0): 50 nodes/141 edges → **0.597 s**; 100 nodes/291 edges → **2.744 s**; 200 nodes → **ERROR (5 s alarm, no output)** — superlinear growth, no usable comparison fixtures beyond ~100 nodes.
- *Gently envelope* (release build, same chain+skip-edge fixture classes): 50/141 ≈ 1 ms; 100/291 ≈ 1 ms; 200 ≈ 2 ms; **1,000 nodes/2,991 edges ≈ 13 ms** (ascii), 1 ms per graphviz/html/txt, **peak RSS ≈ 4.4 MB**; 4,000-node chain ≈ 55 ms. Near-linear, ~150× headroom on the 2 s wall budget, ~58× on the 256 MB RSS budget.

